  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Long-term conservation of maleo nesting ground in North Sulawesi through nest site protection..and management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Long-term Conservation of Maleo Nesting Ground in North Sulawesi Through Nest Site Protection and Management. In partnership with Wildlife Conservation Society, this project will improve the global conservation status of the maleo by ensuring the long-term protection of nesting sites in and around Bogani Nani Wartabone National park. Specific activities include: (1) post wildlife guards at the four known nesting grounds to ensure safe hatching of eggs; (2) increase support from the local community by creating educational activities about maleo conservation with local community members; (3) build protected structures to protect nests from extreme weather events; (4) work with wildlife guards to develop additional plan of action in the event of extreme weather , such as moving hatcheries to higher ground.</narrative>
  </description>
